# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# Frontend / Tauri
node_modules/
dist/
.svelte-kit/
src-tauri/target/

# Local-only notes and transcripts
docs/cursor_agentic_workflow_in_cursor.md
docs/prompts/phase2-agent-orchestrator.md

# Claude Code per-project state (scheduled_tasks.lock etc.)
.claude/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
docs/private-github-guide.md
*.code-workspace

# Sprint 28 Stage 7: the hook SIDECAR is a build artefact, produced by
# build/build-hook-sidecar.sh on every runner before tauri-action. Tracking it
# would put a ~5MB binary per target in git and let a stale one ship — the exact
# thing the build script rebuilds to prevent.
src-tauri/binaries/
